  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "The given equation is \n\n42 ÷ 7 − 64 + 11 × 6 = 4\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nNow, interchanging the symbols then equation will be:\n\n \n\nOption 1:** **÷ and −\n\n42 - __7 ÷ 64__ + 11 × 6\n\n= 42 - 0.1 + __11 × 6__\n\n= __42__ - 0.1 __+ 66__\n\n= 108 - 0.1\n\n= 107.9 ≠ 4\n\nOption 2: × and +\n\n__**42 ÷ 7**__ − 64 × 11 + 6 \n\n= 6 - __**64 × 11**__ + 6 \n\n= __**6**__ - 704 __**+ 6**__ \n\n= 12 - 704 \n\n= -692 ≠ 4\n\nOption 3: × and −\n\n__**42 ÷ 7**__ × 64 + 11 - 6 \n\n= __**6 × 64**__ + 11 - 6 \n\n= __**384 + 11**__ - 6 \n\n= __**395 - 6**__ \n\n= 389 ≠ 4\n\n \n\n**Option 4:** + and -\n\n__42 ÷ 7__ + 64 - 11 × 6\n\n= 6 + 64 - __11 × 6__\n\n= 6 + 64 - 66\n\n= 70 - 66\n\n= 4 = 4.\n\n \n\nHence the equation will be corrected after interchanging \"+ and −\".\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
